[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u3063\u304B\u308A\u6697\u304F\u306A\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u306D\u30FC\u3002\n\u3053\u308C\u306F\u5F37\u6575\u304C\u51FA\u3066\u304D\u305D\u3046\u306A\u4E88\u611F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s gotten so dark already...\nI have a feeling we might run into some tough enemies!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u3001\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\uFF01\n\u3069\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait a minute, Sophie!\nWhat are you talking about!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\uFF1F\u3000\u4F55\u304C\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What do you mean?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F55\u304C\uFF1F\u3000\u3058\u3083\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\u0027What do you mean?\u0027 That\u0027s my line!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6025\u306B\u5909\u306A\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u30A2\u30C8\u30EA\u30A8\u3092\u98DB\u3073\u51FA\u3057\u305F\u308A\u3057\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Suddenly saying strange things and\nrushing out of the atelier like that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u3055\u3063\u304D\u306E\u8A71\u306E\u6D41\u308C\u3067\u3001\n\u5F37\u3044\u9B54\u7269\u3068\u6226\u304A\u3046\u3001\u306A\u3093\u3066\u8A71\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How did our previous conversation lead to\nwanting to fight strong monsters!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u30FC\u3001\u3042\u306F\u306F\u3002\n\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5148\u8D70\u308A\u3059\u304E\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u304B\u306A\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, ahaha.\nMaybe I got a bit ahead of myself?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306E\u306D\uFF01\u3000\u3069\u3046\u3044\u3046\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u4F5C\u308C\u3070\u3044\u3044\u306E\u304B\u306F\n\u3084\u3063\u3068\u898B\u3048\u3066\u304D\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You see! I finally figured out what kind of\nchocolate I should make, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u60F3\u3044\u3092\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u306B\u8FBC\u3081\u308B\u304B\u3092\n\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306A\u308A\u306B\u8003\u3048\u3066\u307F\u305F\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was thinking about how to pour my feelings\ninto the chocolate in my own way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u306F\u3001\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u3084\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\u4F5C\u308A\u306E\u5E2B\u5320\u3067",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To me, Plachta, you\u0027re my mentor in\nalchemy and baking..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u540C\u6642\u306B\u3001\u4EF2\u826F\u3057\u306E\u53CB\u9054\u3067\u3082\u3042\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But at the same time, you\u0027re also\nmy dear friend..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3063\u3066\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u306F\u3001\n\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u5F53\u305F\u308A\u524D\u306E\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That feeling is so natural to me\nthat I take it for granted."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3053\u305D\u2026\u2026\u305D\u306E\u5927\u5207\u3055\u3092\u3001\n\u5B9F\u611F\u3057\u306B\u304F\u304F\u306A\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\u306A\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that\u0027s exactly why... I thought maybe\nI\u0027m not appreciating how special it really is."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5C11\u3057\u3001\u5206\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u5B9F\u306F\u79C1\u3082\u3001\n\u305D\u306E\u3053\u3068\u306B\u6C17\u4ED8\u3044\u305F\u304A\u304B\u3052\u3067\u3001\u60A9\u307F\u304C\u6674\u308C\u305F\u306E\u3067",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand a little. Actually, realizing that\nhelped clear up my own worries."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u4ECA\u65E5\u3001\u68EE\u3067\u7D20\u6750\u3092\u96C6\u3081\u3066\u3044\u305F\u6642\u306B\u3001\n\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u304C\u9B54\u7269\u306B\u8972\u308F\u308C\u304B\u3051\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Today in the forest while gathering materials,\nyou were almost attacked by a monster, weren\u0027t you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3\u3068\u30E9\u30F3\u30C4\u30A7\u306E\u304A\u304B\u3052\u3067\u3001\n\u4F55\u4E8B\u3082\u306A\u304F\u7121\u4E8B\u3067\u3057\u305F\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks to Heidi and Lanze,\nnothing bad happened, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306E\u6642\u306B\u3001\u6539\u3081\u3066\u5B9F\u611F\u3057\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At that moment, I realized something anew."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u306E\u7121\u4E8B\u3092\u7948\u308B\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u304C\u3001\n\u3053\u3093\u306A\u306B\u3082\u5927\u304D\u3044\u3001\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just how deeply I care about\nyour well-being."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF01\u3000\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "! I see...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u304C\u5148\u306B\u7B54\u3048\u306B\u305F\u3069\u308A\u7740\u3044\u305F\u306E\u306F\u3001\n\u304D\u3063\u3068\u3042\u306E\u7D4C\u9A13\u304C\u3042\u3063\u305F\u304B\u3089\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The reason I found my answer first was\nsurely because of that experience."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3057\u3066\u2026\u2026\u304D\u3063\u3068\u4ECA\u306E\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u3082\u3001\n\u540C\u3058\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8003\u3048\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u306F\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And... I think you\u0027re probably\nthinking the same thing now?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u3002\u304D\u3063\u3068\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3046\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I think that\u0027s exactly it...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u3054\u304F\u5F37\u3044\u9B54\u7269\u3068\u6226\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u7121\u4E8B\u306B\u52DD\u3064\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u305F\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we fight a really strong monster\nand manage to win..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3064\u3082\u304A\u4E16\u8A71\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u308B\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u306B\u3001\n\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u304A\u8FD4\u3057\u304C\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3063\u305F\u306E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought it might be a way to properly thank you\nfor everything you\u0027ve done for me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u306E\u304A\u304B\u3052\u3067\u3001\u3053\u3093\u306A\u306B\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u308C\u3066\u308B\u3002\n\u8DB3\u308A\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3082\u3042\u308B\u3051\u3069\u3001\u5C11\u3057\u305A\u3064\u524D\u306B\u9032\u3081\u3066\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks to you, I\u0027ve gotten so much stronger.\nI still have room to grow, but I\u0027m moving forward bit by bit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\uFF01\u3000\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3082\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\uFF01\n\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306E\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3092\u3001\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u306B\u8FBC\u3081\u305F\u3044\u3093\u3060\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, thank you! Please continue looking after me!\nThat\u0027s the feeling I want to put into the chocolate!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3002\u7A7A\u56DE\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\u6C17\u3082\u3057\u307E\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u306E\u8003\u3048\u306F\u3088\u304F\u5206\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see. It might be a bit roundabout, but\nI understand what you\u0027re thinking."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u306A\u308C\u3070\u3002\u79C1\u3082\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u6226\u308F\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3051\u307E\u305B\u3093\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In that case, I\u0027ll have to fight alongside you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3084\u3001\u4F55\u3092\u9A5A\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, why do you look so surprised?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u306E\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u306E\u8A71\u306E\u901A\u308A\u306A\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If what you said is true..."
        }
      },
